{"2502780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator", "steam_appid": 2502780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranger's Path: National Park Simulator will expand during Early Access! Here's our official roadmap:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/822d47fe848b696603f351bbdafef2fa.avif?t=1787553665\" width=1080 height=1550 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Update 2 is now live!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This update adds new wildlife, new mission-based animal interactions, and more ranger duties across the park. Encounter Boar, Bobcat, and Bison, help injured animals, free wildlife from illegal traps, track animals with GPS devices, and use new tools like the Tranquilizer Gun and Root Puller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also take on new environmental tasks and callouts, including invasive plant removal, planting new flora, campsite cleanup, and handling visitor issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the roadmap above for a full overview of what's been added, and what's still to come as Ranger's Path continues to grow throughout Early Access.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/be9ac9c0b7ac445d003c242fd2560820.avif?t=1787553665\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator, you take on the everyday responsibilities of a park ranger in the stunning Faremont National Park. Keep the park running, protect the local ecosystem, and support the people who visit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle a wide range of ranger duties and ensure park rules are respected. One moment, you may be completing routine maintenance. The next, you could be searching for a missing hiker or responding to an urgent wildlife callout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faremont’s diverse landscape stretches from dense forests and open meadows to winding rivers. Use your ranger vehicles to travel along the park’s road network and reach remote areas filled with waterfalls, rock formations, and scenic viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protecting Faremont’s wildlife is one of your most important responsibilities. Track animals across the wilderness, rescue wildlife in distress, and secure traps before they can cause further harm. Use specialized ranger equipment to follow signals, safely approach animals, and respond to each situation with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From elusive wolves and imposing bison to mischievous raccoons, a diverse range of wildlife brings Faremont National Park to life. Observe animal behavior through your camera, discover new species, and expand your personal wildlife lexicon as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your responsibility also extends to Faremont’s visitors. Guide hikers, check permits, respond to emergencies, and investigate suspicious behavior. Handle incidents such as vandalism, prohibited items, littering, or disturbances to keep the park safe and welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond urgent callouts, you’ll inspect plant health, remove invasive growth, restore affected areas, clean campsites, restock supplies, and transport materials across the park. Every completed task contributes to your park rating, unlocking new missions and equipment as your ranger career progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your ranger hat and begin your journey in Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEP INTO THE WILD: Begin your ranger career in the stunning Faremont National Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE PARK: Discover forests, meadows, riversides, scenic landmarks, and remote locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROTECT WILDLIFE: Track animals, rescue wildlife in distress, secure dangerous traps, and document species with your camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPPORT VISITORS: Help hikers, check permits, inspect backpacks for prohibited items, and respond to emergencies or suspicious behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CARE FOR FAREMONT: Maintain trails, protect plant life, remove invasive species, clean campsites, restock supplies, and complete transport tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE RANGER EQUIPMENT: Follow tracking signals and handle wildlife, maintenance, and investigation tasks with specialized tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR RANGER CAREER: Improve your park rating and unlock new missions and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPERIENCE DYNAMIC DAYS: Adapt to changing weather, shifting tasks, and unexpected callouts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/be9ac9c0b7ac445d003c242fd2560820.avif?t=1787553665\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/5464902ba2ae9cc0532a99d620eb323e.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator, you take on the everyday responsibilities of a park ranger in the stunning Faremont National Park. Keep the park running, protect the local ecosystem, and support the people who visit it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handle a wide range of ranger duties and ensure park rules are respected. One moment, you may be completing routine maintenance. The next, you could be searching for a missing hiker or responding to an urgent wildlife callout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Faremont’s diverse landscape stretches from dense forests and open meadows to winding rivers. Use your ranger vehicles to travel along the park’s road network and reach remote areas filled with waterfalls, rock formations, and scenic viewpoints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e74eee35ab5e3df5f268ac60cca581b4.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protecting Faremont’s wildlife is one of your most important responsibilities. Track animals across the wilderness, rescue wildlife in distress, and secure traps before they can cause further harm. Use specialized ranger equipment to follow signals, safely approach animals, and respond to each situation with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From elusive wolves and imposing bison to mischievous raccoons, a diverse range of wildlife brings Faremont National Park to life. Observe animal behavior through your camera, discover new species, and expand your personal wildlife lexicon as you explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your responsibility also extends to Faremont’s visitors. Guide hikers, check permits, respond to emergencies, and investigate suspicious behavior. Handle incidents such as vandalism, prohibited items, littering, or disturbances to keep the park safe and welcoming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond urgent callouts, you’ll inspect plant health, remove invasive growth, restore affected areas, clean campsites, restock supplies, and transport materials across the park. Every completed task contributes to your park rating, unlocking new missions and equipment as your ranger career progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your ranger hat and begin your journey in Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.poster.avif?t=1787553665\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.webm?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/extras/e0b91e9c53e1be768db9db3a88acab3e.mp4?t=1787553665\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEP INTO THE WILD: Begin your ranger career in the stunning Faremont National Park</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPLORE THE PARK: Discover forests, meadows, riversides, scenic landmarks, and remote locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PROTECT WILDLIFE: Track animals, rescue wildlife in distress, secure dangerous traps, and document species with your camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUPPORT VISITORS: Help hikers, check permits, inspect backpacks for prohibited items, and respond to emergencies or suspicious behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CARE FOR FAREMONT: Maintain trails, protect plant life, remove invasive species, clean campsites, restock supplies, and complete transport tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >USE RANGER EQUIPMENT: Follow tracking signals and handle wildlife, maintenance, and investigation tasks with specialized tools</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BUILD YOUR RANGER CAREER: Improve your park rating and unlock new missions and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EXPERIENCE DYNAMIC DAYS: Adapt to changing weather, shifting tasks, and unexpected callouts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Begin your ranger journey in Ranger’s Path: National Park Simulator. Maintain trails, assist visitors, track wildlife, rescue injured or trapped animals, and explore diverse biomes filled with varied species.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Czech, Polish, Slovak<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I can recommend this game to anyone who wants a quiet, peaceful game to lose hours into.”<br>9/10 – Nerdy Bird Games<br><br>“If you have always wanted to be a national park ranger, this simulator is made for you.”<br>Softonic<br><br>“The environment’s general warmth, portrayed through sunshine, is enough to make you want to continue exploring this virtual world.”<br>NYVGGC<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/8001f5cd9e5d39cada8e59426db70890c13e23bb/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1787553665", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502780/74c44b8b880a25005aadf3d34df8227941c1ff10/cap